#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:50
#: ce36e7a2a937416092f78331f689dbed
msgid "The Gimbal controller's red and black power wires should be connected directly to a 3S or 4S battery."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:53
#: d87bb05447e74f349fc2049cd701eab4
msgid "The Pitch, Roll and Yaw (if present) gimbal motors should be connected to MOT1, MOT2 and MOT3 respectively."
